RetroShader Lab — notice for public/samples
===========================================

The screenshots in this directory are in-game snapshots taken from the
libretro-thumbnails project:

    https://github.com/libretro-thumbnails/libretro-thumbnails

They were selected because they are captured with shaders and filters disabled
and are stored at the native output resolution of each system, which makes them
accurate inputs for testing shader pipelines:

    Game Boy / Game Boy Color   160x144
    Game Boy Advance            240x160
    NES                         256x240
    SNES                        256x224
    Mega Drive / Genesis        320x224
    PlayStation                 320x240
    PSP                         480x272

The exact upstream path of every file is recorded in index.json.
No image has been resized, cropped or re-encoded.

