If you are a rights holder and want an image removed, delete the file from this
directory and its entry from index.json — the lab falls back to its built-in
generated test patterns.

Palettes
--------
The two Game Boy screenshots were captured in the flat four-shade greyscale and have
been recoloured to Gambatte's "TWB64 040 - DMG Ver." palette with `npm run palette`.
Only the PLTE chunk was rewritten, so the pixels are the originals untouched. The
greyscale versions are kept in `originals/`, which the asset manifest does not scan.
